          <li><a href="https://www.floridarealtors.org/newsroom/flas-housing-market-closed-sales-and-new-pending-sales-rise-july">Florida REALTORS® July 2026 housing report</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.fox5vegas.com/2026/08/06/report-las-vegas-home-prices-pull-back-record-high-july-2026/">FOX5 report citing Las Vegas REALTORS® July 2026 data</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.nashville.gov/sites/default/files/2025-09/UHS-Full-Report.pdf?ct=1759160211">Metro Nashville Unified Housing Strategy</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://nashvillerealestatedata.com/blog/nashville-under-300k-house-contracts">Nashville Real Estate Data: under-$300K detached-house contracts</a></li>
        </ul>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

